msgstr "Engedélyezve saját javaslatszöveget adhat meg."

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/strongswan.js:156
msgid ""
"When this is enabled, the routes for all XFRM interfaces are set "
